      ],
      "rulesText": "**Lucky Thirteen**: a one-off battle. One hero (30 HP) against three monsters: the Hollow Stalker, the Gloom Witch and the Mask Reaper (6 HP each).\n\n- On your turn, **Strike** one living monster. Roll the die and add your attack (3). That is the damage.\n- Then the monsters **strike**. Each living monster rolls its own die and hits you for the roll, less 1 armour.\n- The monsters react at random, so the same position can go either way.\n- Last monster standing wins. If the hero reaches 0 HP first, the monsters win.\n\n**Assumptions**\n- Monsters have 6 HP each and the hero has 30 HP and attack 3. Tune these in the rules options.\n- Each monster strikes once per round, and the hero always has one strike.\n- There is no healing, guard or item.",
